  "title": "What happens if my claim is rejected?",
  "metaDescription": "&nbsp;This is your blog post. Blogs are a great way to connect with your audience and keep them coming back. They can also be a great way to position yourself",
  "h1": "What happens if my claim is rejected?",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
